{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8486d2f0f8db8817cdbb4e3cc6b72ee77e8905b29068a7aca4a0d222d253f5e0", "ja": "お疲れさま、のり子。衣装の試着中か。\nうん。すごく似合ってて、カワイ……。", "zh": "辛苦了，法子。你在试穿服装啊？\n嗯，很适合、很可……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "3df91a2fa67d2b141e1eadd975a41e469f3fcb6a047be8edf677732710cb0769", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待って{$P$}！\nストップ、ストーップ！！", "zh": "等、等一下，{$P$}！\n别说了、别说了──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "931c5a6c8c13c06d1d9185cf6d748a5695db9db397660d23a63b07459f8ab7dc", "ja": "不意打ちはダメだってば！　ボクシングだって\nプロレスだって、ゴングが鳴ってから試合開始だよ！？", "zh": "不能这样突袭啦！无论拳击或职业摔角，\n比赛都是在铃声响起后才开始的喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1003_p", "source_sha256": "aee514bc785ef0dcdc0d89152373fa4c64cd9dae9ab094234386080e528e81d3", "ja": "う、うん……すまない、何の話だ？", "zh": "是、是喔……抱歉，你在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "b06d28b79b9d6a1e7e34330e4dfa078879fed9519a7a1f4e6002ac6487d2859a", "ja": "今、カワイイって言おうとしたでしょ！\nそれ、不意打ちのドロップキックみたいなものだから！", "zh": "你刚刚想说我很可爱吧！？\n那就像是使出飞身踢突袭人一样啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "2592e3f16bbef27e71cd3b0ec25b4a6ef92a34b059bcd8e9fa76d064fa76499c", "ja": "ノーガードでいきなり食らったら、\n一発KOもありえるくらい危ない技なんだからね！", "zh": "要是在毫无防御下直接被踢中，\n甚至可能被一击KO，这招就是这么可怕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "09155fb31631389cf9a0d06507e6b45eeb8ec20f00cce1a554917b58c4e01aac", "ja": "要するに、照れるって事か？　のり子も立派な\nアイドルだし、そろそろ慣れてほしいんだけど……。", "zh": "简单说就是在害羞吗？不过法子你已经是个\n百分百的偶像了，希望你能慢慢开始习惯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "6a56c48b6b18e00caeaabff8a61739a531e44d6c6c2eb250ecf2592e882dcd61", "ja": "アタシだって、すこしは慣れたつもりだし。\nわかってる、わかってるんだけどさ～！", "zh": "我也很努力尝试去习惯啊，\n这些我都知道，我都知道嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "fcc0f83c423cdcdd16afb21a96c003c0723313b6cbb08745307f1384b67df721", "ja": "今日みたいな、こんなカワイイ衣装だって、\n似合うかも？って思えるようになったし……。", "zh": "像今天这种可爱风的服装，\n我也开始觉得自己说不定很适合了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1009_p", "source_sha256": "824b222cbfbaf323a210a5db690911b92cdf82db783bc9d84c14c062483d8048", "ja": "うーん、そうか。もう少し場数を踏めば……\nよし、のり子。特訓しよう！", "zh": "唔～这样啊，那只要再累积一点经验……\n好，法子，我们来特训吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "cfec9578df395bb29972ecf54229520c4576f33f01d65db137f368d9b28f294a", "ja": "特訓？\n何か、イヤな予感がするんだけど……。", "zh": "特训？\n我有种不好的预感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1011_p", "source_sha256": "af8a895d36f78cf76241cc90eecc9c8ad3d5c8747185d357e2f87f0ec7888113", "ja": "今からのり子にカワイイって言うから、慣れてくれ。\n場数を踏むんだ！", "zh": "我现在要夸你可爱了，快习惯吧。\n要累积经验！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "952fb7660bb19552f297a113b6839d45afd07c31edad86f89eded6152b34102a", "ja": "えええええっ！？\nし、仕方ないなぁ……うう……。", "zh": "咦咦咦咦咦！？\n没、没办法了……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2e6026405e645aa7623aa60185997b655a28f6420b49f4514d748c5b6219fcdc", "ja": "それじゃ早速行くぞ！　……のり子、カワイイな！\nその衣装、完ぺきな着こなしだ！", "zh": "那就赶紧开始吧！法子，你好可爱！\n穿上那套服装简直浑然天成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "e6475d1ba9332f4f6d9d390aa24ed13aaa3964e96b34565bea6c6fec17282e90", "ja": "うっ……ま、まだまだっ！\nこんなもんじゃ、アタシは倒れ……いや、照れないよ！", "zh": "呜……我、我撑得下去！\n这点小事岂能把我击倒……不，岂能让我害羞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5f8d7fbeabf490185d210eb350c8d9dc583f0ec070a6300ccde5947009049bb7", "ja": "劇場に、のり子っていう最高に\nカワイイアイドルがいるって、話題になってしまうな！", "zh": "粉丝间一定会开始热议，\n说剧场里有个叫法子的超可爱偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "886cb61deff83d8423c0e8d75d2672a8eb538365f88ba926aa2f12d8674d389d", "ja": "うえっ！？　……ま、まだまだぁっ！", "zh": "唔咦！？……我、我还可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1017_p", "source_sha256": "71a668fdb200e81d14bd8f8cf01b4941c7b41e4c97fa259b225569755598a391", "ja": "こんなにも可能性と魅力が詰まったアイドルを\n担当できて、俺は幸せだ！　ありがとう、のり子！", "zh": "能负责带你这样充满可能性与魅力的偶像，\n我实在太幸福了！谢谢你，法子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "7a318194ca9b711f9108c953317a40ebb28979a6781b4f477de60bec21909a52", "ja": "う、うぅ……うわーっ！\nアタシ、アタシ……もうダメーっ！！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……呜哇──！\n我、我……不行了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1019_se", "source_sha256": "9993c258d80ec3a8039dc412dc9291cbc9071e55cfba08f2f904f63521136a26", "ja": "バシーンッ！", "zh": "啪──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ef4b85842070b9f7f75350962d88b4e049e1461966b3ee392b6d4704614c2c64", "ja": "ぐふぅっ！？", "zh": "呜呃！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "7715d6af03387db9515db2a0c324acd9e5cfeb61fccda18d056518e5893113d2", "ja": "ああっ！？　{$P$}、ゴメン！\n思わず手が……だ、大丈夫っ！？", "zh": "啊啊！？{$P$}，对不起！\n我管不住自己的手……你、你还好吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1022_p", "source_sha256": "95003371f703f90b73b8b63a15092e591855f4fc4347f78dc5c463fc37202687", "ja": "いや、鋭い掌底だった……。\n今まで経験した事がないくらい、強烈だったよ。", "zh": "好一记火辣辣的掌底攻击……\n是我从没经历过的强烈冲击呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "3d6975a49b6c421aa685277395403910b95f7351612d2478a06b0f7a8123a45b", "ja": "ほ、本当にゴメンね……\nだって{$P$}が……ううっ。", "zh": "真、真的很抱歉……\n因为{$P$}一直……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0114_1024_p", "source_sha256": "d004d9221e6b3d50e10e9e13b22dbbcf5a9209024f2a8995ff92adaef5ee94cb", "ja": "（照れるのり子も……いや、やめておこう。\n言ったら、今度こそ一発KOされてしまいそうだ……）", "zh": "（害羞的法子也……不，还是别说吧。\n要是说了，感觉这次真的会被一击KO……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
